---
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
---

<section id="contact" class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex justify-center">
    <div class="h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-turquoise/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
    <p data-reveal class="font-display text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.3em] text-turquoise-deep">CONTACT</p>
    <h2 data-reveal class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-black text-balance text-ink sm:text-4xl">
      一緒に、何かやりませんか。
    </h2>

    <div data-reveal class="mt-8 space-y-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:text-lg">
      <p>「一緒に何かやりたい」</p>
      <p>「こんなの作ってほしい」</p>
      <p>「これ面白そうじゃない？」</p>
      <p class="mt-4">そんな連絡も、大歓迎です。</p>
    </div>

    <a
      href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}
      data-reveal
      class="group mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-turquoise-deep px-8 py-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-ink hover:shadow-xl"
    >
      <svg
        class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-12"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <path d="M3 8l9 6 9-6" />
        <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" />
      </svg>
      {SITE.email}
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
